## Appendix A — Known Limitations

| # | Limitation | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Olist dataset ends Oct 2018; customers near the end had limited repeat-purchase opportunity | 3.05% repeat rate is a **lower bound**, not the true long-run rate | Note in report; consider cohort-based analysis for v2 |
