| 4 | Dataset lacks marketing channel / campaign data | Nov 2017 spike's 98% new customers cannot be causally attributed to any specific campaign | Report as "associated with new customer acquisition" not "caused by" |
| 5 | Review coverage calculation includes reviews for non-delivered orders | Marketplace poor review rate (14.69%) includes some non-delivered orders | 99.33% of delivered orders (95,831 of 96,478) have reviews; comparisons remain valid |
| 6 | Freight is a proxy for distance/weight; actual distance not available | Freight-lateness correlation cannot be decomposed into distance vs weight | Note as limitation; geolocation could enable distance calc in v2 |
| 7 | No pre/post-delivery sentiment tracking | Cannot distinguish "poor review because late" from "poor review despite late" | Recommend customer feedback instrumentation |

